      "updated_at": "2022-07-01T07:34:14Z",
      "body": "This is actually a duplicate of https://github.com/vector-im/riot-web/issues/2458 which covers avatars. vector-im/element-web#5488 has nothing to do with this issue.\r\n\r\nAlthough, re-reading the description I question whether this is actually a duplicate at all. It kinda sounds like the desirable is to have multiple avatars for yourself that are shown to specific users, not just rooms. As in if I wanted to show you my blue avatar wherever I am, but show everyone else my green avatar.",
