      "created_at": "2018-06-08T22:27:13Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-06-08T22:34:47Z",
      "body": "@turt2live thats basically my point, yes. Especially for introducing Riot/Matrix to family is this the thing that is preventing use. Many people don't want to provide image or full name public, which can be found by username, in search or public channels too. And thats one such case and one big reason why I can't give Riot/Matrix to about 15 other people/devices I manage.\r\n\r\nOther messengers e.g. have \"nobody/my contacts/everybody\" option. Which means messengers default image or the user image. This is okay too, but not ideal.",
